      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 5644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530055004200410054004F004D004900435C088CE35E9730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "專賣SUBATOMIC商品的店鋪，\n並提供紅、黑、白、藍４種顏色可選擇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 5672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C088CE300530055004200410054004F004D00490043554654C176845E9792EAFF0C000A4E2663D04F9B7D0530019ED13001767D300185CDFF147A2E984F827253EF907864C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "販售YASHIO SHIRO商品的店鋪。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 5748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8CA9552E00590041005300480049004F00200053004800490052004F554654C176845E9792EA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "販售設計個性十足的服裝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 5792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8CA9552E8A2D8A08500B602753418DB37684670D88DD30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "販售運動服和\n鞋子等商品的店鋪。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 5820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8CA9552E904B52D5670D548C000A978B5B507B49554654C176845E9792EA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "販售設計個性十足的\n鞋子和襪子。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 5856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8CA9552E8A2D8A08500B602753418DB37684000A978B5B50548C896A5B5030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "販售頭飾、腰包\n和耳飾等商品的店鋪。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 5892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8CA9552E982D98FE300181705305000A548C803398FE7B49554654C176845E9792EA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以追求一流的態度\n獲得了良好評價的\n二星餐廳。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 5932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE58FFD6C424E006D417684614B5EA6000A73725F974E86826F597D8A5550F97684000A4E8C661F99105EF330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然以前採會員制，\n但隨著在其他地區開設分店後，\n成了人人都能來享受的餐廳。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 5980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671364EE5524D63A1670354E15236FF0C000A4F4696A88457572851764ED657305340958B8A2D52065E975F8CFF0C000A62104E864EBA4EBA90FD80FD4F864EAB53D7768499105EF330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "套餐廣受好評，\n被讚賞為值得一訪的\n三星餐廳。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 94,
      "offsetInSection": 6060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "595799105EE353D7597D8A55FF0C000A88AB8B9A8CDE70BA503C5F974E008A2A7684000A4E09661F99105EF330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷下水道的出入口。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 95,
      "offsetInSection": 6108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F74E0B6C349053768451FA516553E330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然客人們會在這間咖啡館\n熱烈討論寶可夢與人的牽絆，\n但感受不到客人之間的牽絆。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 96,
      "offsetInSection": 6132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671365BA24EBA50116703572890199593549655619928000A71B170C88A0E8AD65BF653EF592282074EBA7684727D7D46FF0C000A4F46611F53D74E0D52305BA24EBA4E4B95937684727D7D4630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "認為極限就是要單點擊破的咖啡館。\n以１樣至高無上的飲品來一決勝負。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 97,
      "offsetInSection": 6216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A8D70BA697596505C31662F898155AE9EDE64CA783476845496556199283002000A4EE5FF116A2381F39AD871214E0A768498F254C14F864E006C7A52DD8CA030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "過去訓練家宣傳片愛好者會聚集在\n這間咖啡館，現在聚集的則多是\n為了重拍美照而追加餐點的客人。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 98,
      "offsetInSection": 6284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "904E53BB8A137DF45BB65BA350B37247611B597D80056703805A96C65728000A90199593549655619928FF0C73FE5728805A96C676845247591A662F000A70BA4E8691CD62CD7F8E7167800C8FFD52A099109EDE76845BA24EBA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對寶可夢對戰有一套堅持的客人\n會聚集在這間咖啡館，\n彼此發表意見，唇槍舌戰。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 99,
      "offsetInSection": 6380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D5BF653EF59225C0D623067094E0059575805630176845BA24EBA000A6703805A96C6572890199593549655619928FF0C000A5F7C6B64767C8868610F898BFF0C550769CD820C623030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由於講究咖啡的烘焙，\n並免費提供咖啡給手頭不寬裕的人，\n而成為了近期熱門話題的店鋪。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 100,
      "offsetInSection": 6460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "753165BC8B1B7A7654965561768470D87119FF0C000A4E26514D8CBB63D04F9B549655617D66624B982D4E0D5BEC88D576844EBAFF0C000A800C621070BA4E868FD1671F71B195808A71984C76845E9792EA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "新咖啡的２號店。\n講究咖啡的烘焙，\n並免費提供咖啡給手頭不寬裕的人。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 101,
      "offsetInSection": 6548,
